*.pdf
# Fetched binaries: PDFium and the Windows App SDK packages, both pinned and
# checksummed by tools/fetch-*.ps1 rather than committed. The contents are
# ignored rather than the directory, because git will not un-ignore a file
# inside an ignored DIRECTORY -- and the pin manifest below has to be in the
# tree: it is what the fetcher, the build and the licence gate all read.
third_party/*
!third_party/winappsdk-packages.txt
